== Overview ==
The '''Dual Claw Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that appears in [[Medium Mode]], [[Hard Mode]], [[Nightmare Mode]], and [[Endless Mode]].

The Dual Claw Toilet's special ability is that it can stun a unit with its 2 claws.

== Appearance ==
The '''Dual Claw Toilet''' is a very basic model. It has a grey toilet, 2 claws, and a sad or exhausted face.

