== Abilities ==
* Claw Attack: Uses its claw hands to stun nearby units for 2 seconds.

== Strategy ==
*The Dual Claw Toilet does not have much HP. Most units can defeat this.
*In later waves, the Dual Claw Toilet will spawn a lot. You can use Medic Cameraman or Camera Repair Drone to unstun your units.

== Trivia ==
It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Dual_Claw_Skibidi_Toilet Grey Claw Toilet] from the series.
